        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="deployment-evidence" value="Evidence: docs/local-lan-mail-queue.md, documented LAN setup and inventory.md. Separate web and queue PHP processes share local persistence.&#10;Database-queued verification and after-commit decision mail use SMTP. USB keyboard input is an assumption; hardware was not tested. No LAN addresses shown." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#292929;strokeColor=#A50021;fillColor=#FFFDF8;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
